# JVM options for the CLI launcher on Java 17+.
#
# One option per line; blank lines and lines whose first non-space character is
# '#' are ignored. The launcher skips this file on Java 8/11 so those JVMs can
# report the required version instead of failing on unknown options.
#
# JLine/Jansi native terminal and reflection access:
--enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED
--add-opens=java.base/java.lang=ALL-UNNAMED
--add-opens=java.base/java.io=ALL-UNNAMED
--add-opens=java.base/java.util=ALL-UNNAMED
--add-opens=java.base/sun.nio.ch=ALL-UNNAMED
--add-exports=java.base/sun.nio.ch=ALL-UNNAMED
